{"seq":2,"slug":"tenant-customization-extensibility","title":"租户定制化与可扩展性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/multi-tenancy-patterns/advanced-patterns/tenant-customization-extensibility","wordCount":1516,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"租户定制化与可扩展性\">租户定制化与可扩展性</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>可扩展性框架</strong>：让定制化在共享代码之上以配置和插件形式存在的架构机制</li>\n<li><strong>EAV（Entity-Attribute-Value）</strong>：通过三列结构（实体、属性、值）支持动态自定义字段的模式</li>\n<li><strong>规则引擎</strong>：按租户配置的条件-动作规则，支持业务流程定制化</li>\n<li><strong>安全沙箱</strong>：在进程/网络/资源隔离的环境中执行租户自定义代码的安全容器</li>\n<li><strong>Webhook 可靠投递</strong>：通过重试、HMAC 签名、幂等性保证对外通知的 at-least-once 语义</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"定制化的困境-共享与个性的张力\">定制化的困境：共享与个性的张力</h2><p>多租户的本质是「同一套代码服务所有人」——但现实中，不同租户总会有差异化需求：定制字段、专属工作流、独有集成、品牌白标。如何在保持代码单一性的前提下支撑租户级定制，是多租户架构演进中最具挑战性的设计问题。</p>\n<p>一旦为单个客户 fork 代码分支，你就失去了多租户的所有优势——版本碎片化、维护成本线性增长、Bug 修复需要 cherry-pick 到 N 个分支。正确的做法是建立一套<strong>可扩展性框架</strong>，让定制化在共享代码之上以配置和插件的形式存在。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 错误方式&#10;        FORK[为每个大客户 Fork 代码] --&gt; V1[版本 A&lt;br/&gt;租户 Acme]&#10;        FORK --&gt; V2[版本 B&lt;br/&gt;租户 Globex]&#10;        FORK --&gt; V3[版本 C&lt;br/&gt;租户 Initech]&#10;        V1 --&gt; PAIN[维护噩梦&lt;br/&gt;N 个分支 × M 个 Bug Fix]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph 正确方式&#10;        CORE[单一核心代码] --&gt; EXT{可扩展性框架}&#10;        EXT --&gt; CFG[配置层&lt;br/&gt;租户级参数]&#10;        EXT --&gt; PLUGIN[插件层&lt;br/&gt;租户专属逻辑]&#10;        EXT --&gt; THEME[外观层&lt;br/&gt;白标/品牌]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph 错误方式\n        FORK[为每个大客户 Fork 代码] --&gt; V1[版本 A&lt;br/&gt;租户 Acme]\n        FORK --&gt; V2[版本 B&lt;br/&gt;租户 Globex]\n        FORK --&gt; V3[版本 C&lt;br/&gt;租户 Initech]\n        V1 --&gt; PAIN[维护噩梦&lt;br/&gt;N 个分支 × M 个 Bug Fix]\n    end\n\n    subgraph 正确方式\n        CORE[单一核心代码] --&gt; EXT{可扩展性框架}\n        EXT --&gt; CFG[配置层&lt;br/&gt;租户级参数]\n        EXT --&gt; PLUGIN[插件层&lt;br/&gt;租户专属逻辑]\n        EXT --&gt; THEME[外观层&lt;br/&gt;白标/品牌]\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"定制化层次模型\">定制化层次模型</h2><p>按定制深度从浅到深，可分为五个层次：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层次</th>\n<th>定制内容</th>\n<th>实现机制</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>L1 配置</td>\n<td>参数值/开关</td>\n<td>租户级配置表</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>默认语言、时区、货币</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L2 外观</td>\n<td>UI 主题/品牌</td>\n<td>CSS 变量 + Logo 资源</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>白标（White Label）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L3 字段</td>\n<td>自定义数据模型</td>\n<td>EAV 或 JSON 扩展列</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>自定义表单字段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L4 流程</td>\n<td>业务规则/工作流</td>\n<td>规则引擎/DSL</td>\n<td>中-高</td>\n<td>审批流程自定义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L5 代码</td>\n<td>自定义逻辑注入</td>\n<td>插件/Webhook/脚本</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>自定义计算逻辑</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"l1-l2-配置与外观定制\">L1-L2：配置与外观定制</h2><h3 id=\"租户级配置管理\">租户级配置管理</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface TenantConfig {&#10;  tenantId: string;&#10;&#10;  // L1: 基础配置&#10;  locale: string; // &#39;zh-CN&#39; | &#39;en-US&#39; | ...&#10;  timezone: string; // &#39;Asia/Shanghai&#39;&#10;  currency: string; // &#39;CNY&#39; | &#39;USD&#39;&#10;  dateFormat: string; // &#39;YYYY-MM-DD&#39;&#10;&#10;  // L1: 功能开关&#10;  features: {&#10;    advancedReporting: boolean;&#10;    apiAccess: boolean;&#10;    ssoEnabled: boolean;&#10;    webhooksEnabled: boolean;&#10;    customFields: boolean;&#10;  };&#10;&#10;  // L2: 品牌外观&#10;  branding: {&#10;    logoUrl: string;&#10;    primaryColor: string;&#10;    faviconUrl: string;&#10;    customDomain?: string;&#10;    emailFromName: string;&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TenantConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  tenantId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // L1: 基础配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  locale</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 'zh-CN' | 'en-US' | ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  timezone</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 'Asia/Shanghai'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  currency</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 'CNY' | 'USD'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  dateFormat</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 'YYYY-MM-DD'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // L1: 功能开关</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  features</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    advancedReporting</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    apiAccess</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    ssoEnabled</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    webhooksEnabled</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    customFields</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // L2: 品牌外观</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  branding</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    logoUrl</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    primaryColor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    faviconUrl</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    customDomain</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    emailFromName</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>配置加载的性能优化：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>进程内缓存</td>\n<td>启动时加载热租户配置到内存</td>\n<td>读多写少的配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分层默认值</td>\n<td>platform → plan → tenant 三级覆盖</td>\n<td>避免每个租户都写全量配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>配置变更事件</td>\n<td>通过事件总线通知所有节点刷新</td>\n<td>实时生效需求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>版本化配置</td>\n<td>每次变更生成新版本，支持回滚</td>\n<td>防止配置错误导致故障</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"l3-自定义字段\">L3：自定义字段</h2><h3 id=\"eav-模式-entity-attribute-value\">EAV 模式（Entity-Attribute-Value）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 字段定义表&#10;CREATE TABLE custom_field_definitions (&#10;  id BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  tenant_id UUID NOT NULL,&#10;  entity_type TEXT NOT NULL,     -- &#39;order&#39;, &#39;customer&#39;, &#39;product&#39;&#10;  field_name TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  field_type TEXT NOT NULL,      -- &#39;text&#39;, &#39;number&#39;, &#39;date&#39;, &#39;enum&#39;, &#39;reference&#39;&#10;  is_required BOOLEAN DEFAULT false,&#10;  validation_rules JSONB,&#10;  display_order INT,&#10;  UNIQUE(tenant_id, entity_type, field_name)&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 字段值表&#10;CREATE TABLE custom_field_values (&#10;  id BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  tenant_id UUID NOT NULL,&#10;  entity_type TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  entity_id BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  field_id BIGINT REFERENCES custom_field_definitions(id),&#10;  value_text TEXT,&#10;  value_number NUMERIC,&#10;  value_date TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  value_json JSONB&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_cfv_lookup&#10;  ON custom_field_values(tenant_id, entity_type, entity_id);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 字段定义表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> custom_field_definitions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  tenant_id UUID </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  entity_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,     </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 'order', 'customer', 'product'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  field_name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  field_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 'text', 'number', 'date', 'enum', 'reference'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  is_required </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BOOLEAN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> false,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  validation_rules JSONB,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  display_order </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(tenant_id, entity_type, field_name)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 字段值表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> custom_field_values</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  tenant_id UUID </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  entity_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  entity_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  field_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> custom_field_definitions(id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  value_text </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  value_number </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  value_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  value_json JSONB</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_cfv_lookup</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> custom_field_values(tenant_id, entity_type, entity_id);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"json-扩展列模式\">JSON 扩展列模式</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 在主表上添加 JSONB 扩展列&#10;ALTER TABLE orders ADD COLUMN custom_data JSONB DEFAULT &#39;{}&#39;;&#10;&#10;-- 结合 JSON Schema 验证&#10;-- 每个租户有自己的 schema 定义&#10;CREATE TABLE tenant_schemas (&#10;  tenant_id UUID NOT NULL,&#10;  entity_type TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  json_schema JSONB NOT NULL,   -- JSON Schema v7&#10;  PRIMARY KEY(tenant_id, entity_type)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 在主表上添加 JSONB 扩展列</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ALTER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ADD</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> COLUMN custom_data JSONB </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{}'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 结合 JSON Schema 验证</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 每个租户有自己的 schema 定义</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> tenant_schemas</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  tenant_id UUID </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  entity_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  json_schema JSONB </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- JSON Schema v7</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(tenant_id, entity_type)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>查询灵活性</th>\n<th>性能</th>\n<th>类型安全</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>EAV</td>\n<td>可索引单字段</td>\n<td>中（多 JOIN）</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n<td>字段数量大、变化频繁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>JSONB 扩展列</td>\n<td>GIN 索引支持</td>\n<td>高（无 JOIN）</td>\n<td>通过 JSON Schema</td>\n<td>字段数量适中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动态 DDL</td>\n<td>完全原生</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>Bridge 模式限定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"l4-工作流与规则引擎\">L4：工作流与规则引擎</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    EVENT[业务事件触发] --&gt; ENGINE[规则引擎]&#10;    ENGINE --&gt; EVAL{评估租户规则}&#10;&#10;    EVAL --&gt;|规则匹配| ACTION[执行动作]&#10;    EVAL --&gt;|无匹配| DEFAULT[走默认流程]&#10;&#10;    subgraph 租户规则库&#10;        R1[IF amount &gt; 10000&lt;br/&gt;THEN require_approval]&#10;        R2[IF category = VIP&lt;br/&gt;THEN auto_approve]&#10;        R3[IF region = EU&lt;br/&gt;THEN add_gdpr_check]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    ACTION --&gt; NOTIFY[发送通知]&#10;    ACTION --&gt; ROUTE[路由到审批人]&#10;    ACTION --&gt; WEBHOOK[触发 Webhook]&#10;    ACTION --&gt; SCRIPT[执行自定义脚本]\">graph TD\n    EVENT[业务事件触发] --&gt; ENGINE[规则引擎]\n    ENGINE --&gt; EVAL{评估租户规则}\n\n    EVAL --&gt;|规则匹配| ACTION[执行动作]\n    EVAL --&gt;|无匹配| DEFAULT[走默认流程]\n\n    subgraph 租户规则库\n        R1[IF amount &gt; 10000&lt;br/&gt;THEN require_approval]\n        R2[IF category = VIP&lt;br/&gt;THEN auto_approve]\n        R3[IF region = EU&lt;br/&gt;THEN add_gdpr_check]\n    end\n\n    ACTION --&gt; NOTIFY[发送通知]\n    ACTION --&gt; ROUTE[路由到审批人]\n    ACTION --&gt; WEBHOOK[触发 Webhook]\n    ACTION --&gt; SCRIPT[执行自定义脚本]</pre><p>规则引擎的关键设计约束：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>约束</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n<th>实现方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>规则隔离</td>\n<td>一个租户的规则不能影响其他租户</td>\n<td>执行时注入 tenant_id scope</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>执行超时</td>\n<td>防止无限循环/死锁</td>\n<td>每条规则 5s 超时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资源限制</td>\n<td>防止规则消耗过多计算资源</td>\n<td>CPU 时间配额</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>版本管理</td>\n<td>规则变更需要可回滚</td>\n<td>版本化 + 灰度激活</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>审计追踪</td>\n<td>需要知道「为什么走了这条分支」</td>\n<td>执行日志记录命中规则</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"l5-插件与-webhook-系统\">L5：插件与 Webhook 系统</h2><p>最深层的定制是允许租户注入自定义代码逻辑：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant App as 核心应用&#10;    participant Hook as Hook 点&#10;    participant Sandbox as 沙箱执行器&#10;    participant Code as 租户代码&#10;    participant External as 外部系统&#10;&#10;    App-&gt;&gt;Hook: 触发扩展点(order.created)&#10;    Hook-&gt;&gt;Sandbox: 加载租户注册的处理器&#10;    Sandbox-&gt;&gt;Code: 在隔离沙箱中执行&#10;    Code-&gt;&gt;External: 可选:调用外部 API&#10;    External--&gt;&gt;Code: 响应&#10;    Code--&gt;&gt;Sandbox: 返回结果&#10;    Sandbox--&gt;&gt;Hook: 处理结果&#10;    Hook--&gt;&gt;App: 继续主流程\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant App as 核心应用\n    participant Hook as Hook 点\n    participant Sandbox as 沙箱执行器\n    participant Code as 租户代码\n    participant External as 外部系统\n\n    App-&gt;&gt;Hook: 触发扩展点(order.created)\n    Hook-&gt;&gt;Sandbox: 加载租户注册的处理器\n    Sandbox-&gt;&gt;Code: 在隔离沙箱中执行\n    Code-&gt;&gt;External: 可选:调用外部 API\n    External--&gt;&gt;Code: 响应\n    Code--&gt;&gt;Sandbox: 返回结果\n    Sandbox--&gt;&gt;Hook: 处理结果\n    Hook--&gt;&gt;App: 继续主流程</pre><h3 id=\"安全沙箱设计\">安全沙箱设计</h3><p>租户代码必须在严格隔离的沙箱中执行：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>隔离层面</th>\n<th>实现方式</th>\n<th>防御目标</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>进程隔离</td>\n<td>独立 worker 进程 / container</td>\n<td>防止崩溃影响主进程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络隔离</td>\n<td>白名单出站 + 禁止内网访问</td>\n<td>防止 SSRF</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资源限制</td>\n<td>CPU 时间 + 内存上限 + I/O 配额</td>\n<td>防止 DoS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>API 表面</td>\n<td>仅暴露受限 SDK（非完整运行时）</td>\n<td>最小权限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超时</td>\n<td>硬超时 10s，超时直接 kill</td>\n<td>防止长阻塞</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"webhook-可靠投递\">Webhook 可靠投递</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface WebhookConfig {&#10;  tenantId: string;&#10;  event: string; // &#39;order.created&#39; | &#39;payment.completed&#39;&#10;  targetUrl: string;&#10;  secret: string; // HMAC 签名密钥&#10;  retryPolicy: {&#10;    maxAttempts: number; // 5&#10;    backoffBase: number; // 1000ms&#10;    backoffMultiplier: number; // 2&#10;  };&#10;  timeoutMs: number; // 10000&#10;  isActive: boolean;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> WebhookConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  tenantId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  event</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 'order.created' | 'payment.completed'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  targetUrl</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  secret</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// HMAC 签名密钥</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  retryPolicy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    maxAttempts</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    backoffBase</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 1000ms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    backoffMultiplier</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  timeoutMs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 10000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  isActive</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>投递保证机制：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>At-least-once</td>\n<td>失败重试确保至少投递一次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HMAC 签名</td>\n<td>接收方验证请求真实性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>幂等性 Key</td>\n<td>每次事件携带唯一 ID，接收方去重</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>死信队列</td>\n<td>重试耗尽后进入人工处理队列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>投递日志</td>\n<td>记录每次尝试的状态码和延迟</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"定制化的边界管理\">定制化的边界管理</h2><p>并非所有定制需求都应该支持。需要建立清晰的边界：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>定制类型</th>\n<th>支持策略</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>配置参数</td>\n<td>自助式</td>\n<td>零开发成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>品牌外观</td>\n<td>自助式</td>\n<td>标准能力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自定义字段</td>\n<td>自助式 + 限制数量</td>\n<td>防止 Schema 膨胀</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工作流规则</td>\n<td>引导式 + 模板</td>\n<td>降低配置错误风险</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自定义代码</td>\n<td>高级版 + 审核</td>\n<td>安全风险需控制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>核心模型变更</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>破坏多租户一致性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>独立版本/分支</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>回到单租户模式</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>原则</strong>：定制化能力应该通过「加法」（在核心之上叠加）而非「改法」（修改核心行为）来实现。一旦定制需要修改核心代码路径，说明扩展性框架设计存在缺陷，需要重新思考抽象边界。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>租户定制化的核心原则是「加法而非改法」——在共享核心代码之上通过配置、Schema 扩展、规则引擎和插件系统叠加个性化能力，绝不为单个客户 fork 代码分支。五层定制模型（配置→外观→字段→流程→代码）提供了按需升级的路径。自定义代码执行必须在安全沙箱中（进程隔离 + 网络白名单 + 资源限制 + 超时保护）。明确定制化的边界——核心模型变更和独立版本分支是不应支持的需求。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>相关文档：<a href=\"multi-region-tenancy\">多区域租户架构</a> 讨论了定制化策略如何在多区域部署中保持一致；<a href=\"migration-consolidation\">迁移与整合策略</a> 处理租户在不同定制级别间升降级的数据迁移问题。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"租户定制化与可扩展性","id":"租户定制化与可扩展性"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"定制化的困境：共享与个性的张力","id":"定制化的困境-共享与个性的张力"},{"level":2,"text":"定制化层次模型","id":"定制化层次模型"},{"level":2,"text":"L1-L2：配置与外观定制","id":"l1-l2-配置与外观定制"},{"level":3,"text":"租户级配置管理","id":"租户级配置管理"},{"level":2,"text":"L3：自定义字段","id":"l3-自定义字段"},{"level":3,"text":"EAV 模式（Entity-Attribute-Value）","id":"eav-模式-entity-attribute-value"},{"level":3,"text":"JSON 扩展列模式","id":"json-扩展列模式"},{"level":2,"text":"L4：工作流与规则引擎","id":"l4-工作流与规则引擎"},{"level":2,"text":"L5：插件与 Webhook 系统","id":"l5-插件与-webhook-系统"},{"level":3,"text":"安全沙箱设计","id":"安全沙箱设计"},{"level":3,"text":"Webhook 可靠投递","id":"webhook-可靠投递"},{"level":2,"text":"定制化的边界管理","id":"定制化的边界管理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"多区域租户架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/multi-tenancy-patterns/advanced-patterns/multi-region-tenancy"},"next":{"title":"迁移与整合策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/multi-tenancy-patterns/advanced-patterns/migration-consolidation"}}